@startuml
title Component Diagram: Containerised Data Mesh Policy-as-Code Architecture

actor "Data Analyst" as User
actor "Governance\nAdministrator" as Admin

package "Client Layer" {
  component "SQL Client\n(DBeaver / CLI / Application)" as Client
  component "JWT Authentication\n(PyJWT)" as JWT
}

package "Query & Governance Layer" {
  component "Trino\nFederated SQL Engine" as Trino
  component "OPA\n(Open Policy Agent)\nPolicy Decision Point" as OPA
  component "OPAL Server\nPolicy Distribution" as OPAL
  component "Git Repository\nRego Policies" as Git
  component "Policy Bundle\nService" as Bundle
}

package "Metadata Layer" {
  component "Project Nessie\nVersioned Catalog" as Nessie
  component "Apache Iceberg\nOpen Table Format" as Iceberg
}

package "Storage Layer" {
  database "Customer Domain\nMinIO Bucket" as Customer
  database "Deposits Domain\nMinIO Bucket" as Deposits
}

package "Testing & Monitoring Layer" {
  component "Pytest\nCompliance Tests" as Pytest
  component "OPA Decision Logs" as Logs
  component "Audit Reports" as Audit
}

User --> Client
Client --> User
Client --> JWT : Authenticate
JWT --> Client : JWT Token
Client --> Trino : SQL Query + JWT
Trino --> Client
Trino --> OPA : Authorization Request\n(RBAC only - datamesh.query.allow)
OPA --> Trino : Allow / Deny
Trino --> Nessie : Resolve Metadata
Nessie --> Iceberg
Iceberg --> Customer : Read Customer Tables
Customer --> Iceberg
Iceberg --> Deposits : Read Deposit Tables
Deposits --> Iceberg
Iceberg --> Trino

Admin --> Git : Commit Policy
Git --> OPAL : Repository Update
OPAL --> Bundle : Build Bundle
Bundle --> OPA : Push Bundle
OPA --> Logs : Decision Logs
Pytest --> Trino : Execute Test Queries
Pytest --> OPA : Masking Decision\n(masked_columns) - applied client-side
Pytest --> OPA : Cross-Domain Decision\n(crossdomain.allow) - checked client-side
Pytest --> Logs : Verify Decisions
Logs --> Audit

note right of OPA
  Rego Policy Enforcement
  • RBAC
  • Column Masking
  • Cross-Domain Restriction
  • GDPR Article 5
  • BCBS 239
  • FCA Compliance
end note

note right of OPAL
  Continuous Policy Distribution
  • Watches Git
  • Builds Bundles
  • Pushes Policies
  • Zero Downtime Updates
end note

note bottom of Nessie
  Git-like Metadata Versioning
  • Branches
  • Commits
  • Tags
  • Isolated Catalog
end note

note bottom of Iceberg
  Open Table Format
  • ACID Transactions
  • Schema Evolution
  • Time Travel
  • Snapshot Metadata
end note

note right of Customer
  Customer Data
  • customer_records
  • pii_fields
  • contact_details
  • personal_information
end note

note right of Deposits
  Deposits Data
  • deposit_accounts
  • balances
  • transactions
  • risk_information
end note

@enduml
